## Erlang VM flags for the release (see `mix help release`).

## Scheduler busy-waiting stays at the BEAM defaults. Turning it off (+sbwt/+sbwtdcpu/+sbwtdio
## none) saves a little CPU when idle but makes every SQLite call (a dirty-IO NIF) pay for
## waking a sleeping thread and then its scheduler again: ~25% fewer message posts on 4 CPUs
## (bench/PERF.md).
